  "ID": "59047",
  "post_title": "El colegio Virgen del Carmen de Onda celebra el Día Carmelita",
  "post_date": "2015-10-01 14:40:23",
  "post_name": "el-colegio-virgen-del-carmen-de-onda-celebra-el-dia-carmelita-2",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Educación|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/DiaCarmelitaColesOndaYvila-realEnVirgen-deGracia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(81 fotos) El colegio Virgen del Carmen de Onda est&aacute; viviendo todo este mi&eacute;rcoles, 1 de octubre, el D&iacute;a Carmelita, en que el alumnado de Infantil y Primaria sustituye las clases por actividades relacionadas con la celebraci&oacute;n, incluso con intercambio con el centro hom&oacute;nimo de Vila-real.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1180189.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">A primera hora, en el patio del colegio, ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, profesores y profesoras, padres y madres han realizado oraciones, y han cantado, bajo la direcci&oacute;n del padre David Oliver Felipo.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180124.jpg\" alt=\"p1180124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180125.jpg\" alt=\"p1180125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180126.jpg\" alt=\"p1180126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180127.jpg\" alt=\"p1180127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180129.jpg\" alt=\"p1180129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180130.jpg\" alt=\"p1180130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180131.jpg\" alt=\"p1180131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180132.jpg\" alt=\"p1180132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180133.jpg\" alt=\"p1180133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180134.jpg\" alt=\"p1180134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180136.jpg\" alt=\"p1180136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diacarmelita15/p1180137.jpg\" alt=\"p1180137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e